  "title": "Vegan Baked Oatmeal Patties",
  "description": "Cooked oatmeal combined with onion, oil, spaghetti sauce, pecans, yeast, and spices is baked into hamburger-style patties. Excellent smothered in mushroom soup and sour cream.",
  "authors": [
    "Vicki Erskine"
  ],
